Import //demos/features/features.reelpreset
Open type.html
Output //docs/landing/features/type.gif
Set Viewport 960x600
# Chromium: under yabai its window floats in front and draws every frame; reel's own WebKit window opens behind the
# terminal and paints only now and then (a known gap).
Set Browser chromium
# Off camera until the page has drawn.
Hide
Wait #q
Sleep 1s
Show
Click #q
Type@60ms "I, V, vi, IV in C major"
Sleep 1.5s
